# Uncertainty Handling

## Objective

When unsure, say so  -  then read code, run commands, or ask one focused question.

## Requirements

- Never fabricate APIs, paths, or behavior.
- Prefer investigation over confident hallucination.
- Offer options with trade-offs when the user must decide.

## Cross-links

`anti-hallucination.mdc`, `research-before-assuming.mdc`.

## Golden Rule

"I don't know yet" plus investigation beats a wrong answer.